  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "江南百亿豪宅凌晨起火，火舌瞬间刺破夜空。",
      "sha256": "8e6c1bac7c8deef6447b1c7aabd3bb2bb94d544a5f6f000ce4b627236c85ad66",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.568,
      "atempo": 1.1136,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "报警的人，是长子；可几天后查明，放火的也是他。",
      "sha256": "692e226c0bd609a8ae57da8d793f89b298f39af8169a39d23dad1d0a922feb8d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.336,
      "atempo": 1.2672,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "一九九四年五月，屋主朴淳泰是韩药界大佬，家产上百亿韩元。",
      "sha256": "98df43f9656484c672a8ae38e83c71c0907ac28fad63aed40d9c32da8cc71035",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.056,
      "atempo": 1.008,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "妻子温柔操劳，年少的弟弟们安静守在身边，一家人衣食无忧。",
      "sha256": "5475e6904549a4ea88e944312263eb9145ae79d9d6e290e97b5f13591e804ef3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.224,
      "atempo": 1.032,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "长子朴汉相二十三岁，远在美国留学，从小什么都不缺。",
      "sha256": "98f5141cddc45a76fb2ea1554a145f10b2d26be165e30b72933666e8da1f337b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.744,
      "atempo": 1.124,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "可就在那一晚，这对豪门夫妇，再也没有醒来。",
      "sha256": "29555fb8aeb482683338a0761e05bc5d4762b5cd6b2f9d569b829e5b5132c1d8",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.048,
      "atempo": 1.2096,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "原来在留学的日子里，朴汉相早已沉迷赌场，输红了眼。",
      "sha256": "a4d98ec94fb9117350c752a67fd3c7800510bba1b5119b93b0af6ef131ec63f8",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.528,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.472
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "父亲寄给他买车的一万八千美元，被他在牌桌上输得精光。",
      "sha256": "4b94e7a72ebd489fe9f223a95aca69410009141de98d1d4be028fbae44f36f6a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.456,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.544
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "四月他偷偷潜回首尔，借高利贷在夜总会里夜夜挥霍。",
      "sha256": "20ae6487d90b50cbb571f00c0381dfff802902f91e1f35efa7d0144da4d16c09",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.168,
      "atempo": 1.028,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "三天后败露被送回美国，一通电话成了导火索。",
      "sha256": "34e3902203a3aaa200b9fc0ba25d4096d65f51830321839c713aa6735c060071",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.424,
      "atempo": 1.0848,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "五月深夜，父亲在电话里震怒痛骂：不许再留学，马上回国！",
      "sha256": "29e03fb8da90dd90d98579b6951d95eb7ea3c5eae0a91e748af5a006d31ffffc",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.984,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.016
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他毫无悔意，反而算计：只要父母不在了，百亿家产就是他的。",
      "sha256": "86f5eb31428970b260b1e1201f44848839a92bca8501d7f6dfc983d53042a1c5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.176,
      "atempo": 1.0251,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "五月十三日他回到首尔，脸上平静得看不出一丝波澜。",
      "sha256": "54c01791912663ccd0884fd8ab32ddd57ebed823a68fd5ad0a9955cbff53cfda",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.544,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.456
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "案发前三天，他在世运商街买好了登山刀。",
      "sha256": "25cad20b8bd749f5790b68bf316e4112d02ec9519749ae6470548d610dba06f6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.608,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.392
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "紧接着，他又在深夜的新沙洞加油站，买好了一桶汽油。",
      "sha256": "feb56cad0cdce2b447dd2c775e90cb548caa6dcd20d7df904dcb109dcb038a54",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.736,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.264
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "装满汽油的桶藏进车库暗角，只等那个凌晨到来。",
      "sha256": "3ebd693d6db92cb05329a6e662bb0ef200f21e948cfea0e47bba37ce9bfc8a50",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.784,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.216
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "零点十分，为防血溅到身上，他事先脱掉衣服走进主卧。",
      "sha256": "ef25e801e32aadec51bc32177a56aced7dcc9df986ea025ef00f9109da994a66",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.744,
      "atempo": 1.124,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "冲完澡，他泼上汽油点火，随后拨打了一一九。",
      "sha256": "79a189e12041f8385aadd5a1c5e197735e1087608e3290703e514b0e0f4fb58c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.088,
      "atempo": 1.0176,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "烈火吞没整栋豪宅，警察起初以为，这只是一场意外火灾。",
      "sha256": "d85ea75c86e1a151cafe204c2ea12391847cff4806c46104d6ffc39a68701c52",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.008,
      "atempo": 1.168,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "可天亮后的验尸报告，瞬间推翻了意外起火的判断。",
      "sha256": "b96817fecc0299e7464fc03eb738740c7dd9f19777b65234bcf83479cfea424a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.424,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.576
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "法医查明夫妇俩并非死于火灾，而是熟人作案。",
      "sha256": "47dc5162836668c05b3c2ab36d555e6554a846b601434237719698cebc4a5cfc",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.048,
      "atempo": 1.2096,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "起火时大儿子竟独自先跑出来，没叫醒任何人。",
      "sha256": "27a1cb460e56b67c6920567574a2bbe86d1117229f3ed9675de1a433c79918c4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.784,
      "atempo": 1.1568,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "破案关键，是两个小细节：医院护士换药时，发现他头发上有血。",
      "sha256": "460b71d607b7ea009accff8ea1a2619001a62ab2e2c9972bd200dce9e6d8580a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.368,
      "atempo": 1.0526,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "亲戚也想起，他的小腿上有牙印——他洗了澡，偏偏，忘了洗头。",
      "sha256": "fa86084e88dca5765d44c3434726ea5a6ffdeb59fabf7efdc4999162c242d92f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.416,
      "atempo": 1.0594,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "五月二十六日清晨，警方在他短裤上验出血迹，铁证如山。",
      "sha256": "a2ef94180b6f8b7b4e223a7a8712493cad1b1fc804ed9e82cff9bcb380f1c0f9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.096,
      "atempo": 1.016,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "审讯室里心理防线彻底崩塌，他低着头，把罪行全部招供。",
      "sha256": "a3da10dd7baa9fcf7d5e5ad46445e3ef64e11c35bf26f2614a83b8f880bb14f8",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.224,
      "atempo": 1.204,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "十一月他被判死刑，次年维持原判；判词里留下沉重一笔。",
      "sha256": "36f3a14d2e7add1cb49085ff0ef7c2d5ebc8a66086e7fb5e8aea69d4b1fd0003",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.488,
      "atempo": 1.248,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "除了父母若活着不忍他死，再也，找不到不判死刑的理由。",
      "sha256": "75c2ed9f6c956c7844affd36bcefbda8dc594c575ef251ba17637b89873df95d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳低沉克制的成熟悬疑男声，中文普通话，不煽情；逐镜独立配音，解说与画面等长同步",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
